  <h2 style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;What is Crypto</h2>

  <h3>📘 Definition</h3>

  <p>Crypto (Cryptocurrency) refers to digital or virtual currencies that use cryptography for security 

  and operate on blockchain technology. Examples include Bitcoin and Ethereum.</p>

  <h3>🧠 Understanding</h3>

  <p>Crypto markets are decentralized, meaning no central authority controls them. 

  Prices are driven by supply and demand, market sentiment, and liquidity. 

  Crypto trading is known for high volatility, creating both opportunities and risks.</p>

  <h3>📊 Key Concepts</h3>

  <ul>

    <li><b>Coin:</b> A cryptocurrency with its own blockchain (e.g., Bitcoin).</li>

    <li><b>Token:</b> A cryptocurrency built on an existing blockchain.</li>

    <li><b>Wallet:</b> Used to store crypto assets.</li>

    <li><b>Exchange:</b> Platform for buying and selling crypto.</li>

    <li><b>Volatility:</b> Rapid price movement.</li>

    <li><b>Market Cap:</b> Total value of a cryptocurrency.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🔍 Identification / How it Works</h3>

  <ol>

    <li>Crypto assets are created and stored on blockchain.</li>

    <li>Transactions are verified by network nodes.</li>

    <li>Prices change based on buying and selling pressure.</li>

    <li>Traders analyze charts to predict price movement.</li>

  </ol>

  <h3>⚠️ Conditions</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Crypto market is highly volatile.</li>

    <li>Prices can change rapidly within minutes.</li>

    <li>Always use secure wallets and trusted exchanges.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧪 How to Trade</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Choose a reliable exchange.</li>

    <li>Analyze market structure, liquidity, and trends.</li>

    <li>Use proper risk management (SL, TP).</li>

    <li>Avoid emotional trading during high volatility.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>❌ Mistakes</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Trading without understanding the project.</li>

    <li>Ignoring volatility.</li>

    <li>Not securing wallets properly.</li>

    <li>FOMO (Fear of Missing Out) trading.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧠 Psychology</h3>

  <p>Crypto trading requires discipline due to its fast movements. 

  Controlling emotions like greed and fear is essential for long-term success.</p>

  <h3>📌 Summary</h3>

  <p><b>Crypto</b> = digital assets on blockchain.<br />

  Key points: <b>decentralization, volatility, wallets, exchanges</b>.<br />

  Trade with knowledge, security, and proper risk management.</p>

</div>
